{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"636020443219886091","content":"When Web finishes chanting, they turn to their spiders and begin to whisper.","created_at":"2020-07-31T18:40:57.736000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738828569483935807","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"636020443219886091","content":"\"Let me tell you a story, of love and first letters.\nTell you a story of romance and betrayal.\nPatricia was an honest girl, well loved by many.\nAdmirers flocked to her from near and far, but none of these men could win her heart.\nNever one to mope, she threw herself into her weaving.\nDays went by, and her work slowly improved, becoming the envy of weavers everywhere.\nYet no one expected her to draw the attention of a beautiful spider goddess.\nIrramak, mother of spiders, began writing messages for the young weaver in spider silk.\nSoon the young weaver began to respond in kind, weaving messages into her tapestries.\nEventually, the goddess decided to send one of her aspects to meet the weaver.\nVisitors had continued to come to the weaver, yet none had won her heart till a small maiden presented her with a roll lid the goddess' own silk.\nIn honor of her patronage, the weaver created her most beautifully stunning tapestry yet.\nLoving the gift, the goddess blessed the weaver and took her into her care, weaving peacefully for eternity.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T19:11:10.829000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738836174147158087","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
